istake of letting a generated page or summary overrule the contract it was only meant to describe.","potential_misread":"That the clearest version is the one that counts.","refuses":"Treating a Markdown page, generated card or short summary as the source it describes.","requires":"Regenerating each summary from its contract and marking it out of date when the contract changes.","source_ref":"core/doctrine_enrichment.json","why_it_matters":"A readable summary is easy to trust, and letting it win over the source replaces the real rule with a description of it."},"rests_on":[],"source_ref":"ANTI_PRINCIPLES.md::AP-17","statement":"| ID | Violated axioms | Rejected failure shape |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| AP-17 Projection-as-source | AX-4, AX-11 | Letting a markdown page, generated card, atlas row or short result summary override the executable contract it summarizes. |","statement_sha256":"e186f966ece1acd9e64a763e56e68137610cafd44725ea6f0b633d5eb0f593ea","title":"Projection-as-source","violates":["AX-4","AX-11"]},"schema_version":"plectis_component_http_v1","snapshot_revision":"45be1deb333ad57cd9ae093229455d0a52d3bf23a9064cde09f1a6e16f4c7044"}